{"id":"91804cbc70f118b6","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-minimal-pair.md","title":"Turing度的最小对","display":"df-minimal-pair — Turing度的最小对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-minimal-pair","aliases":["43-df-minimal-pair"],"display":"df-minimal-pair — Turing度的最小对","depends_on":["[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.11.2, definition after Theorem 5.11.1","source_printed_pages":"37","source_pdf_pages":"57","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-minimal-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-minimal-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-pair — Turing度的最小对"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.11.2, definition after Theorem 5.11.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"57"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 量化于自然数子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T(A,B)\\iff A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\land B\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left((C\\le_TA\\land C\\le_TB)\\Rightarrow C\\le_T\\varnothing\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T(A,B)\\iff A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\land B\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left((C\\le_TA\\land C\\le_TB)\\Rightarrow C\\le_T\\varnothing\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小对要求双方都非零，且共同下锥只含零度。它强于不相容性，也不同于“每一方本身是极小度”。形式定义使用集合代表元，归约等价保证不依赖代表元。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，§5.11.2, definition after Theorem 5.11.1，印刷页37，PDF页57。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$C$ 量化于自然数子集，$\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T(A,B)\\iff A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\land B\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left((C\\le_TA\\land C\\le_TB)\\Rightarrow C\\le_T\\varnothing\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1340,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-minimal-pair]] — Turing度的最小对"},{"id":"36789a9822044619","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B$ 量化于自然数子集；$\\operatorname{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\operatorname{MinimalPair}_T$ 见 [[43-df-minimal-pair]]。"}],"outgoing":["0784d1de3a88cd94"]}